 "stimulus_html": "The science department of a high school has received a grant for 34 laptops. They plan to apportion them among their six classrooms based on each classroom’s student capacity. Use the standard quotas in the table below to answer each question.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Room</th>\n<th>Room Capacity</th>\n<th>Room’s Standard Quota</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"30 \\div 4.88 \\approx 6.15\">30 \\div 4.88 \\approx 6.15</span> laptops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"25 \\div 4.88 \\approx 5.12\">25 \\div 4.88 \\approx 5.12</span> laptops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>28</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"28 \\div 4.88 \\approx 5.74\">28 \\div 4.88 \\approx 5.74</span> laptops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"32 \\div 4.88 \\approx 6.56\">32 \\div 4.88 \\approx 6.56</span> laptops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"24 \\div 4.88 \\approx 4.92\">24 \\div 4.88 \\approx 4.92</span> laptops</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F</td>\n<td>27</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"27 \\div 4.88 \\approx 5.53\">27 \\div 4.88 \\approx 5.53</span> laptops</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n",
 "questions": [
